                    Box 219, CIEP. Confidential. A copy was sent to
                        Kissinger.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d101-f2" n="2" xml:id="d101-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d100">Document 100</ref> and <ref target="#d101-f2">footnote
